<title>USA: Regency Health stake upped by Tweedy Browne.</title>
<headline>Regency Health stake upped by Tweedy Browne.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Tweedy Browne Co L.P. said Friday it raised its stake in Regency Health Services Inc to 1,236,838 common shares or 7.39 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions inlude the purchase of 191,300 common shares between February 19 and March 12 at prices ranging from $10 to $10.97807 per share.</p>
<p>Regency Health, based in Tustin, Ca., operates a speciality healthcare facility in California, Ohio, New Mexico and West Virginia.</p>
</text>
